REGIONAL REGULATION OF BATU BARA REGENCY

NUMBER 2 OF 2016

CONCERNING

ADMINISTRATION OF PROTECTION FOR WOMEN

AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF BATU BARA,

Considering : a. b. c. d. that every citizen has the right to obtain security and freedom from all forms of Violence; that Women and Children including vulnerable groups who tend to experience Violence which constitutes an act that violates human rights need to obtain legal Protection; that the administration of Protection for Women and Children Victims of Violence needs to be supported by institutions and regulations so that its implementation can be guaranteed; that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Administration of Protection for Women and Children Victims of Violence;

In view of :

1. * Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);
3. Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic l

Indonesia of 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette

of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);

4. Law Number 5 of 2007 concerning the Establishment of Batu Bara Regency in North Sumatra Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2007 Number 7, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4681);

5. Law Number 21 of 2007 concerning the Eradication of i

the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2007 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);

6. Law Number 12 of 2011 concerning the Formulation of Laws and Regulations (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234);

O

7. Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587), as has been amended several times most recently by Law Number 9 of 2015 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2015 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5679);

8. Law Number 35 of 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 297, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5606);

9. Government Regulation Number 4 of 2006 concerning Administration and Cooperation for Recovery of Victims of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2006 Number 15, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4604);

10.Government Regulation Number 9 of 2008 concerning Procedures and Mechanism of Integrated Services for Witnesses and/ or

Victims of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2008 Number 22, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4818);

11. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 2 of 2008 concerning Guidelines for the Implementation of Protection of Women;

f

C

12. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 3 of 2008 concerning Guidelines for the Implementation of Child Protection;

13. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 1 of 2010 concerning Minimum Service Standards for Integrated Services for Women and Children Victims of Violence;

14. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 5 of 2010 concerning Guidelines for the Establishment and Development of Integrated Service Centers;

15. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 2 of 2011 concerning Guidelines for Handling Child Victims of Violence;

16. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 19 of 2011 concerning Guidelines for the Empowerment of Women Victims of Violence;

17.Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 80 of 2015 concerning the Formulation of Regional Legal Products (State News of the Republic of Indonesia of 2015 Number 2036);

18. Regional Regulation of Batu Bara Regency Number 1 of 2009 concerning Government Affairs that are the Authority of the Batu Bara Regency Government;

With Mutual Approval

THE REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES OF BATU BARA REGENCY and

THE REGENT OF BATU BARA

